---
title: Guacamole
course: Side
servings: 6
locale: en_GB
prep time: 10m
difficulty: Easy
cuisine: Mexican
diet: Vegetarian
tags:
- savoury
- side-dish
- vegetarian
- mexican
---

Cut the @ripe avocados{2} in half and remove the stones. Scoop out the flesh and mash coarsely.

Combine the avocado with the remaining ingredients (@onion{0.5}(finely chopped), @garlic{2%cloves}(finely chopped), @tomatoes{3}(diced), @green chilli, such as Jalapeño or Kenya{0.5}(finely chopped), @lime juice{2%tbsp}, @ground cumin{0.25%tsp}, @salt, and @cayenne pepper{}). Serve immediately, or cover tightly with clingfilm to prevent discolouration.

> If the top does discolour, stir well before serving.